<title>USA: Parker Hannifin stock split, div increase.</title>
<headline>Parker Hannifin stock split, div increase.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker Hannifin Corp said on Thursday it declared a three-for-two stock split and a 12.5 percent increase in its cash dividend.</p>
<p>The company increased the dividend on a pre-split basis to $0.225 per share from $0.20.  The post-split quarterly payout increased to $0.15 per share from $0.133 per share, or $0.60 per year.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid and additional shares distributed September 5 to shareholders of record on August 21.</p>
<p>Parker Hannifin produces motion control compnents and systems for industiral, automotive and aerospace markets.</p>
</text>
